  <sys:String x:Key="Help.Subtitle">Review the basic usage below and choose your preferred language.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Help.LanguageLabel">Display language</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Help.Body">1. Copy one or more text files in File Explorer.&#10;&#10;2. ClipBoardBinder detects supported text files from the clipboard and combines their contents into a single text block.&#10;&#10;3. Paste anywhere to insert the merged text.&#10;&#10;4. Use Remove Selected or Clear File Clipboard to manage the prepared file list.&#10;&#10;5. Files that are too large, binary, or unreadable are skipped automatically.</sys:String>
